---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Commercial Support"
  description="Tailored services and an enterprise subscription for companies using Rugix."
>
  <h1>Commercial Support</h1>

  <p>
    Rugix is created and maintained by <a href="https://silitics.com">Silitics</a>,
    an independent software company specializing in embedded Linux products.
    We provide engineering services and commercial support for teams that use
    Rugix in production.
  </p>

  <p>Our services include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Linux platform development</strong>, from initial architecture
      through production images and release pipelines.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Architecture and production-readiness reviews</strong> for
      updates, persistent state, recovery, security, and compliance.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Hardware and boot-flow integrations</strong> for devices that
      Rugix Bakery or the Rugix Yocto layers do not support out of the box.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Security engineering</strong>, including secure boot, encrypted
      storage, update signing, and hardened device access.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fleet management integration</strong> with Nexigon, another
      supported platform, or your own backend.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    In addition to tailored services, we also offer an <em>enterprise
    subscription</em> for companies using Rugix in their products. The
    enterprise subscription includes <strong>long-term support</strong> for
    selected Rugix versions, <strong>tailored advice and consulting</strong>
    for your product (at a reduced rate compared to non-subscription
    clients), <strong>priority email support</strong> in case you run into
    any issues, <strong>direct influence on Rugix's roadmap</strong>, and
    access to an <strong>enterprise library</strong> with ready-made
    integrations for a variety of different use cases and common challenges.
    The enterprise subscription ensures the consistent maintenance of Rugix
    while also providing you with tangible benefits in return.
  </p>

  <p>
    Ready to take your project to the next level? Contact us today to discuss
    how our services can help you achieve your goals. Reach out to us via{" "}
    <a href="mailto:contact@silitics.com">contact@silitics.com</a>.
  </p>
</MarketingLayout>
